# The deployer's 24-word recovery phrase: one key on the native and EVM lanes. `npm run new-deployer` writes it here; never type or paste it by hand. Testnet only.
M1_DEPLOYER_MNEMONIC=
# The registry proof's chair identity, a 24-word phrase. `npm run prove:registry` writes it here on its first run; never type or paste it. Testnet only.
PROVE_CHAIR_MNEMONIC=
# The registry proof's first director (Dana), written the same way. Testnet only.
PROVE_DANA_MNEMONIC=
# The registry proof's second director (Eli), the one the proof removes, written the same way. Testnet only.
PROVE_ELI_MNEMONIC=
